  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Introduction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This fully threaded rod is made from high-quality carbon steel, and is available in M3x16mm and M3x30mm sizes. It's durable and great for various DIY projects. Primarily used to connect nuts and secure components, it serves as an essential fixture in U-bolts, hangers, and other applications. Additionally, it pairs perfectly with M3 Aluminum Rod End Ball Joints, offering an effective solution for connections and flexible movement."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Application"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Tightening Connections: Used to fasten two or more components together, providing a stable connection."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Adjustment Devices: Can be used to adjust positions or heights, commonly found in brackets or mechanical structures."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Easy Attachments for Motive Designs: It works great with M3 aluminum rod-end ball joints, allowing for easy attachment and movement. By installing the ball head on top of the fully-thread rod, you can easily achieve design like robotic arms, brackets, and other motive designs."
    }
  ],
