y-content: center;\"> </p>\n<p class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile pct_downloadContent\" style=\"text-align: center; gap: 40px; display: flex; justify-content: center;\"> </p>\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ehmbdrk2hozxYux3qzicNdKznrR\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Introduction</h2>\n<p> </p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ehmbdrk2hozxYux3qzicNdKznrR\">This fully threaded rod is made from high-quality carbon steel, and is available in M3x16mm and M3x30mm sizes. It's durable and great for various DIY projects. Primarily used to connect nuts and secure components, it serves as an essential fixture in U-bolts, hangers, and other applications. Additionally, it pairs perfectly with <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 66);\"><a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/m3-aluminum-rod-end-ball-joint\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 66);\" target=\"_blank\">M3 Aluminum Rod End Ball Joints</a></span>, offering an effective solution for connections and flexible movement.</div>\n<p class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile pct_downloadContent\" style=\"text-align: center; gap: 40px; display: flex; justify-content: center;\"> </p>\n<p class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile pct_downloadContent\" style=\"text-align: center; gap: 40px; display: flex; justify-content: center;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/d466ce01780d439ea5448b07df4f8180/B-AA226_banner.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></p>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-page-id=\"BraMdd9z6owwkNxjI3McPYx2nsb\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C9XLdEyF3oZ3tCx5FeDcb87knpb\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-page-id=\"BraMdd9z6owwkNxjI3McPYx2nsb\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ehmbdrk2hozxYux3qzicNdKznrR\"><br/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"border-color: rgb(173, 173, 173); font-weight: bold; width: 102.555%;\">\n<!-- 表头 -->\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: rgb(199, 199, 199); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-color: rgb(173, 173, 173); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 25%; padding: 10px !important;\">\n<div>Product ID</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: rgb(199, 199, 199); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-color: rgb(173, 173, 173); font-weight: bold; width: 25%; padding: 10px !important;\">\n<div>M (mm)</div>\n<div><strong>Nominal Diameter</strong></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: rgb(199, 199, 199); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-color: rgb(173, 173, 173); font-weight: bold; width: 25%; padding: 10px !important;\">\n<div><strong>P (mm) </strong></div>\n<div><strong>Thread Pitch</strong></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: rgb(199, 199, 199); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-color: rgb(173, 173, 173); font-weight: bold; width: 25%; padding: 10px !important;\">\n<div><strong>L (mm)</strong></div>\n<div><strong>Bolt Length</strong></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: rgb(173, 173, 173); text-align: center; width: 25%; padding: 10px !important;\">AA226</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: rgb(173, 173, 173); width: 25%; padding: 10px !important;\">3.0</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: rgb(173, 173, 173); width: 25%; padding: 10px !important;\">0.5</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: rgb(173, 173, 173); width: 25%; padding: 10px !important;\">16</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: rgb(173, 173, 173); text-align: center; width: 25%; padding: 10px !important;\">AA227</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: rgb(173, 173, 173); width: 25%; padding: 10px !important;\">3.0</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: rgb(173, 173, 173); width: 25%; padding: 10px !important;\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"KSfLdPbP9oLIAqx2bOGcLQ9HnHg\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vbtwddysxofll2x3KWlcFY9Jnif\">0.45</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"lark-record-clipboard\" data-lark-record-data='{\"rootId\":\"KSfLdPbP9oLIAqx2bOGcLQ9HnHg\",\"text\":{\"initialAttributedTexts\":{\"text\":{\"0\":\"22\"},\"attribs\":{\"0\":\"*0+2\"}},\"apool\":{\"numToAttrib\":{\"0\":[\"author\",\"7111124891826602012\"]},\"nextNum\":1}},\"type\":\"text\",\"referenceRecordMap\":{},\"extra\":{\"channel\":\"saas\",\"mention_page_title\":{},\"external_mention_url\":{}},\"isKeepQuoteContainer\":false,\"isFromCode\":false,\"selection\":[{\"id\":1368,\"type\":\"text\",\"selection\":{\"start\":0,\"end\":2},\"recordId\":\"Vbtwddysxofll2x3KWlcFY9Jnif\"}],\"payloadMap\":{},\"isCut\":false}' data-lark-record-format=\"docx/text\"></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: rgb(173, 173, 173); width: 25%; padding: 10px !important;\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"KSfLdPbP9oLIAqx2bOGcLQ9HnHg\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vbtwddysxofll2x3KWlcFY9Jnif\">30</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-icpc pct_padding-in-mobile .pct_hardware-tableList pct_hardware-tableList-t-icpc\">\n<p> </p>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Basic Information</h2>\n<div class=\"pct_icpc pct_grad-2-pc pct_grad-1-mobile pct_hardware-tableList\">\n<!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic-p\">\n<!-- table布局 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\" style=\"padding: 0;\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 0; font-weight: bold;\">\n<!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Surface Treatment</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">Zinc-nickel Alloy Plating</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Type of Thread</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">Complete thread</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- table布局 -->\n</div>\n<!-- 第二条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic-p\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\">\n<!-- table布局 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\" style=\"padding: 0;\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 0; font-weight: bold;\">\n<!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Material</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">Carbon Steel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Color</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">Silver</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- table布局 -->\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 如需添加在此处添加 -->\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"><br/></h2>\n<p> </p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Application</h2>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-page-id=\"BraMdd9z6owwkNxjI3McPYx2nsb\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DCHpdFoo7oaMAhx2urLc0CSgn6d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>\n<strong>Tightening Connections</strong>: Used to fasten two or more components together, providing a stable connection.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KQUfdliTwoximtxkGj1cSnuDnyh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>\n<strong>Adjustment Devices</strong>: Can be used to adjust positions or heights, commonly found in brackets or mechanical structures.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LfbBdZinloDyeMx8Byecn2EKnkf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>\n<strong>Easy Attachments for Motive Designs: </strong>It works great with<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 66);\"> <a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/m3-aluminum-rod-end-ball-joint\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 66);\" target=\"_blank\">M3 aluminum rod-end ball joints</a></span>, allowing for easy attachment and movement. By installing the ball head on top of the fully-thread rod, you can easily achieve design like robotic arms, brackets, and other motive designs.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"><br/></h2>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "This fully threaded rod is made from high-quality carbon steel, and is available in M3x16mm and M3x30mm sizes. It's durable and great for various DIY projects. Primarily used to connect nuts and secure components, it serves as an essential fixture in U-bolts, hangers, and other applications. Additionally, it pairs perfectly with M3 Aluminum Rod End Ball Joints, offering an effective solution for connections and flexible movement.\n\nTightening Connections: Used to fasten two or more components together, providing a stable connection.\n\nAdjustment Devices: Can be used to adjust positions or heights, commonly found in brackets or mechanical structures.\n\nEasy Attachments for Motive Designs: It works great with M3 aluminum rod-end ball joints, allowing for easy attachment and movement. By installing the ball head on top of the fully-thread rod, you can easily achieve design like robotic arms, brackets, and other motive designs.",
  "first_seen": "2026-08-23T00:23:31Z",
